        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 39: 已知一电路图如图所示, $x(t)$ 为输入, $y(t)$ 为输入, 其中 $C = 0.1F$ , $R = 10\\Omega$ , $L = 2H$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            110,
            849,
            152
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\begin{aligned} V_{L}(t) &= L \\frac{d i_{L}(t)}{dt} \\\\ i_{C}(t) &= C \\frac{d u_{C}(t)}{dt} \\end{aligned}$",
        "bbox": [
            34,
            175,
            284,
