        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 求 $H(s)$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            326,
            253,
            347
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{l} {k v _ {L}: \\underbrace {V _ {R} (t) + V _ {L} (t) + y (t)} = x (t)} \\\\ {R \\cdot \\overrightarrow {(t)}} + L C \\frac {d ^ {2} y (t)}{d t} + y (t) = x (t) \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            583,
            272,
            898,
            339
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3)画出零极点图，并判断是否稳定；",
        "bbox": [
