            478,
            371
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ni (t) = C \\frac {d y (t)}{d t}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            571,
            337,
            710,
            375
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(4) 若 $x(t)=2\\cos(2t-1)$ ，求 $y(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            133,
