        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\mathrm{第} u \\mathrm{比} = \\underbrace {y _ {x x}} _ {y _ {x x}} = 2 \\mathrm{式} + - 3 p b\n$$",
