            514,
            588
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nH (s) = \\frac {5}{(s + \\frac {5}{2}) ^ {2} - \\frac {5}{4}}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            584,
            487,
            787,
            541
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n- \\frac {5}{2} \\pm j \\frac {\\sqrt {5}}{2}\n$$",
